  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>About Tierra by Maria:</strong> Tierra by Maria is a no-BS skincare line founded by Venezuelan actress Maria de Faria. On a journey to find non-toxic products, Maria decided to take control of her health and create performance based skincare products that do not compromise our own health or the planet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Our Mission: </strong>Our mission is to empower individuals to embrace their skin's natural beauty while providing effective and ethical skincare solutions.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>USPs:&nbsp;</strong>Cruelty-Free, Vegan, Ethical, Zero Plastic, 100% Natural, Hypoallergenic, Dermatologist-Approved, Toxin Free</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Our Products:</strong> Our skincare products are scientifically designed using advanced biotechnology to rejuvenate, protect, hydrate and strenghten your skin.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://tierrabymaria.com/products/gentle-face-cleanser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Gentle Face Cleanser</a>: This powerful yet gentle formula is packed with natural ingredients that help sweep away daily impurities, while respecting your skin's moisture balance.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://tierrabymaria.com/products/advanced-repair-serum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Advanced Repair Serum</a>: This serum uses powerful ingredients to bring you the perfect combination of moisture, repair, and protection for your skin. Infused with a powerful blend of natural and effective ingredients to restore your skin's youthful glow.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://tierrabymaria.com/products/anti-aging-cream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anti-Aging Cream</a>: The Tierra By Maria Anti-Aging Cream is a powerful ally in the fight against aging, utilizing nature's most rejuvenating ingredients to nourish, protect, and revitalize the skin.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://tierrabymaria.com/products/nourishing-oil-complex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nourishing Oil Complex</a>: Infused with powerful ingredients such as moringa, sea buckthorn fruit oil, papaya, and passion fruit, this nourishing oil complex delivers multiple benefits to your skin.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://tierrabymaria.com/products/stainless-steel-guasha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gua Sha Face Massage Tool:</a> This ancient Chinese tool is traditionally used for gently pushing, scraping and massaging the skin to improve circulation and decrease inflammation. Some of the potential benefits of guasha include promoting blood circulation, improving fine lines and wrinkles, lymphatic drainage, and relieving tension from muscles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Payment Terms</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">As a Tierra by Maria Ambassador, you'll help us spread the word about sustainable skincare that is good for your skin in the long term, without compromising the planet! We process ambassador payments at the end of every month. You can choose to receive a Paypal payout or Store Credit.</p>",
